summary: File: step the playback rate

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``file`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``[`` → ``file:speed down`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``]`` → ``file:speed up`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``shift+backspace`` → ``file:speed reset`` (in the ``file`` panel)
